        "description": "Habit is a goal tracker and streak tracker for building one daily habit at a time. Choose a small action, record each success in three seconds, and see your progress grow.\n\nUse your daily goal tracker for reading, studying or exercise. Keep track of successful days and habit streaks, with reminder notifications to help you take the next step.\n\n■ No. 1 Habit Building App in Japan\n\"Habit\" is the top-ranked habit-building app in Japan across the following criteria:\n① Number of total downloads publicly disclosed\n② Number of documented successful habit streaks\n③ Average rating on the App Store\n④ Number of App Store reviews\n\n■ Key Goals Sustained with This App\n1. Strength Training, Fitness, and Health Care\n・Strength-training exercises (push-ups, planks, crunches, squats, etc., suitable for both home and gym workouts)\n・Stretching and flexibility exercises\n・Recording body fat percentage, blood pressure, blood sugar levels, etc.\n\n2. Weight Loss and Beauty Health\n・Weight loss exercises (core workouts, pelvic exercises, etc.)\n・Beauty (skincare, hair care, etc.)\n・Cardiovascular exercises (walking, jogging, running, etc.)\n・Recording body weight and meals (also suitable for tracking diets)\n・Checking body temperature and overall well-being\n・Short-term fasting or intermittent fasting\n\n3. Learning\n・Studying for qualifications/ certifications\n・Reading books\n・Improving work-related skills (e.g. programming)\n\n4. Hobbies and Musical Instruments\n・Piano\n・Guitar\n・Illustration or drawing\n・Blogging and posting on social media\n・Keeping a diary\n\n5. Household and Lifestyle\n・Organizing, decluttering, cleaning, doing laundry\n・Abstaining from alcohol and smoking\n・Practicing meditation and mindfulness\n・Maintaining regular routines such as brushing teeth, taking showers\n\n\n■ Features and Characteristics\n1. Support for Setting \"Continuable Goals\"\nRecognizing the fact that motivation to sustain actions inevitably weakens over time, the app encourages setting goals that can be consistently pursued every day. It prevents the problem of setting unattainable goals driven by initial enthusiasm, thus avoiding the failure of plans. Unlike traditional to-do lists or task management tools, the app only allows you to set one goal at a time.\n\n2. Three Seconds to Record\nWith a simple (some might say overly simple) design, all you need to do is open the app and tap on the pie chart to complete your input of your record. You'll be greeted by cute stick-figure comments that provide encouragement every day.\n\n3. Reminder Notifications at Best Timing\nIf your goal is to \"read a book,\" for example, you'll receive reminder notifications at convenient times like during your daily commute. This helps prevent any lapses in taking the necessary actions.\n\n4. Celebrate Success at 30 Days\nOnce you achieve your goal, you'll be celebrated with great enthusiasm. It establishes moderate milestones like a \"30-day Ab Challenge\" to prevent falling into a state of complacency and encourages you to maintain motivation by saying, \"Let's keep going from here!\"\n\n\n■ Software License Agreement\nhttps://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\n\n\nEveryone has their own unique ideals.\nThere are various aspirations out there.\n\nHowever, regardless of the specific goals, it is always beneficial to acquire the \"technique of consistency\" in order to prevent any losses of time and enthusiasm. \nBy relying on concrete techniques to sustain actions and develop habits, you will be able to work towards realizing your important ideals without solely relying on motivation and willpower. \nIt will be our sincere pleasure if you acquire such skills and contribute even a little bit to your journey towards achieving your goals.",
